                                "sense_id": "d588a76a-483f-3c88-8eb5-fb2333bc5cf1",
                                "text": "The king, to show that he was not intoxicated with good fortune, nor aspired to a total victory over the parliament, published a manifesto, in which he renewed the protestation formerly taken, with great solemnity, at the head of his army, and expressed his firm intention of making peace upon the reëstablishment of the constitution."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f078acdd-db7c-499b-8b74-37ddb8067cfc",
                                "sense_id": "d588a76a-483f-3c88-8eb5-fb2333bc5cf1",
                                "text": "In general terms he was told to refuse nothing which would dispel all ideas of the reëstablishment of Poland."
                            }
